data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_01e1aa7c10ba22f1016ae8d12720ec87d1b23043a7caf04335","output_index":0,"sequence_number":103,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering weather and timing**\n\nI'm only able to access the current weather, not hourly forecasts. I see I need to calculate the ride time. It turns out that the ride will take about 5 hours and 51 minutes, plus an additional 36 minutes for some buffer, which brings it to around 6 hours and 27 minutes. Currently, it’s 18 degrees with light rain, so I should mention that the user should be prepared for possible rain during the ride without any guarantees. The trip would finish around 20:14 local time."}

